---
description: Hard SEO/Workers indexing guardrails — never regress example.com, og:image slash, sitemap alias, IndexNow, wrangler preview
globs: src/config/site.ts,astro.config.mjs,wrangler.jsonc,public/_redirects,public/**/*.txt,src/layouts/**/*.astro,scripts/audit/**,scripts/postbuild.mjs
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow [docs/SEO-GUARDRAILS.md](docs/SEO-GUARDRAILS.md) and [docs/CUSTOM-DOMAIN.md](docs/CUSTOM-DOMAIN.md).

- **Site URL:** single setting `PUBLIC_SITE_URL` / `DEFAULT_SITE_URL` — never hardcode `workers.dev` outside the allowlist; never `https://example.com`.
- **absoluteUrl:** do not force trailing slashes on file paths (`/og-default.png`).
- **Sitemap alias:** keep `/sitemap.xml` → `/sitemap-index.xml` 301 in `public/_redirects`.
- **IndexNow:** real 32-hex key at `public/<key>.txt` (site root); no `000…0` placeholder.
- **wrangler:** worker 308 (`src/worker.ts`, `run_worker_first`) + `html_handling: "force-trailing-slash"` + `"previews": {}`; no top-level `vars` for `PUBLIC_*`.
- **AEO:** Hammad byline, Person `@id` `github.com/hammadiqbal6#person`, FAQPage on tools/guides; titles 25–65; meta 70–160 (og/twitter match); every guide listed in `llms.txt` with URL + summary.
- After changes: `npm run build && npm run audit` (guardrails must pass).
